{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "513db5dfb2d3ee089366b03a0942845faa6d2e4a8df0a4be122308476d7aa45e", "ja": "グラビア撮影　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6000_place", "source_sha256": "8a588ffd960db13014bf8a1b1b77ed7bfef5ae10c7af8a347cb9bf4dda7b76c6", "ja": "山の入り口", "zh": "山道入口", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6001_p", "source_sha256": "db6944961fffb629740995c6b99f4ec2adf27843b3f3d5340b7e7c9a75a4a144", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、\nエレナのムービーグラビアを撮る予定だ）", "zh": "（今天的计划是为艾蕾娜拍摄动态写真，作为《アイグラ！！》企划的一部分。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6002_018ele", "source_sha256": "ece4d5595a0b3cb9ab62a50e6f92bf67282d0f525c3b6c965ac4fb6c5ae28f0e", "ja": "{$P$}、{$P$}！\nキツネの衣装、すっごくかわいいネ！　ありがとー！", "zh": "{$P$}、{$P$}！\n狐狸的服装超级可爱呢！谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6003_p", "source_sha256": "fb527f9ce70e228198cf3baef01c3a9e47d83264ea4a6103f3dc4ea4bb8bf7ad", "ja": "どういたしまして。エレナにピッタリだと思って\n選んだから、喜んでくれて何よりだよ。", "zh": "不客气。我觉得这套狐狸服装很适合艾蕾娜，所以特意选的。你能喜欢就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6004_018ele", "source_sha256": "c30cd62ccef50fc94afd51fa83d670c395931002feffa6f7bbc2f5b088cedb69", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　それでね、{$P$}。\nワタシ、いいこと思いついちゃった！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪所以呢，{$P$}。\n我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6005_018ele", "source_sha256": "db1b516ffb470735c626dbbe26cf107841ffbc83e9705e3fb60825b75aa04f62", "ja": "今日は動画の撮影でしょ？　だから、ダンスしてる\nところを撮ってもらうのはどうかナって？", "zh": "今天要拍视频，对吧？所以我在想，要不要拍下我跳舞的样子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6006_p", "source_sha256": "8526f2dee32c0f1028f481c24346978fcb659642db02a77b8a79e04b9bb18446", "ja": "お、いいアイディアだな！　エレナの得意分野だし、\nムービーとの相性も良さそうだな。", "zh": "哦，这个主意不错！毕竟是艾蕾娜的拿手领域，和视频应该也很搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6007_018ele", "source_sha256": "d7cdb8a4bd1ec3cfcfac01a1fc97725b66bd74c00f40904d0f3102ad04b948d3", "ja": "ホント！　でも、どんなカンジで踊ればいいかナ～？\n衣装に合うダンスがいいと思うんだケド……。", "zh": "真的！不过，要跳什么感觉的舞才好呢～？\n我觉得应该跳和服装相配的舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6008_018ele", "source_sha256": "97a494e980edb52ce99960539c954baf6dbd776971a4be73dde235dd1fc2c03b", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}は、\nどういうダンスがいいと思う？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}觉得跳什么样的舞比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6009", "source_sha256": "03d9f6405bdd9c416bd2146fe81cb19a83eedc25de01b59efa14d16ef5e3a64b", "ja": "サンバ", "zh": "桑巴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6010", "source_sha256": "846ea8d0f776a22f18050e0f313d7ed3a8d826230e235a2a7d2fbd03c73bd8ce", "ja": "チアダンス", "zh": "啦啦队舞蹈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6011", "source_sha256": "77db8b4e10366b67ea61f7f0953d7249663b7800567176ec165aaee6fe4e2651", "ja": "神楽", "zh": "神乐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6100_p", "source_sha256": "e2e157a7f7d6dff0fbe8449470638bf9e8be3563d9bf381e83517bcc1d2cb044", "ja": "サンバはどうだ？　その衣装で踊るのもかわいいと\n思うし、楽しいムービーになるんじゃないか？", "zh": "桑巴怎么样？穿着那套服装跳舞也很可爱，\n我觉得应该能拍出一段有趣的视频吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6101_018ele", "source_sha256": "6feec09004d7177c3331af87658c00213b75c08ad431641fe939a649ca04feb4", "ja": "サンバ……うん、ピッタリかも！\nしっぽもフリフリ動いて、すっごくかわいいネ！", "zh": "桑巴……嗯，说不定很合适！\n尾巴也一摇一摆的，超级可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6102_018ele", "source_sha256": "95f5db74e1c5281633d9be005994c75c974b17b445695106cf2f176f29414d40", "ja": "みんなに楽しんでもらえるように、思いっきり踊るネ♪\nあ、{$P$}も一緒に踊ろうよ！", "zh": "为了让大家都能开心，我要尽情跳舞啦♪\n啊，{$P$}也一起来跳吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6200_p", "source_sha256": "8289120b59d1ae759b025e9dd52cc90bbffa211b338942b4a7db3e52ee28640f", "ja": "キツネはジャンプ力がすごいって聞いた事があるから、\nチアダンスなんていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我听说狐狸的跳跃力很强，所以跳啦啦队舞怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6201_018ele", "source_sha256": "968e95d4aa3ebc9e0453da169ea6782ffc2054b7bef975addb5e27704c7f3c87", "ja": "へぇーっ、そうなんだ！？\nたしかにチアダンスは、ジャンプ力が大事だもんネ！", "zh": "欸——原来是这样！？  \n确实，啦啦队舞蹈很看重跳跃力嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6202_018ele", "source_sha256": "8d611109b0a9309b07450d2d6745fd2c665a2b44aaf324a6f258760c6871bce0", "ja": "キツネみたいに高くジャンプできるかわからないケド\nがんばってみるヨ！　元気なダンス届けるネ♪", "zh": "虽然不知道能不能像狐狸一样跳得那么高，\n但我会努力试试看的哟！一定会把充满活力的舞蹈带给大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6300_p", "source_sha256": "7cd54bcea33a75bbf67bff308034ce1709992a6257cfc6062c05fd2a27e51bc6", "ja": "神様に歌や踊りを捧げる神楽の中には、\nキツネのお面をつけるものもあるらしいけど……。", "zh": "听说神乐中有些表演是要戴上狐狸面具的……神乐是向神明献上歌舞的仪式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6301_018ele", "source_sha256": "f6b3fd95e149b9322ac3ea71e7b2573e02bfacff558826f5c881aa87f39dd9e5", "ja": "カグラ……？　名前は聞いたことあるような……？\nでも、どんなダンスなのか、わからないヨ～。", "zh": "神乐……？好像听说过这个名字……？\n不过，我不知道那是怎样的舞蹈哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_6302_018ele", "source_sha256": "f9df3fa52bee1fccd38ffa6380bd8f6f4b25c47b6a8c6a6046a312f6035ece9a", "ja": "簡単なダンスならすぐ踊れるケド、神様へのダンスなら\nムズカシイかも……。時間もないし、また今度だネ。", "zh": "简单的舞蹈我马上就能跳会，不过要跳给神明看的舞蹈，可能就有点难了……时间也不够，还是下次再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
